:15.097Z | CODE: 7 | CHAN: Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | IMG: C:\\Windows\\explorer.exe | CMD: \r\n  MSG SUMMARY: Image loaded: | RuleName: - | UtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:54.970\r\n\r\nEVENT_ID: evt-00059 | TS: 2026-05-06T00:00:15.097Z | CODE: 13 | CHAN: Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | IMG: C:\\windows\\Explorer.EXE | CMD: \r\n  MSG SUMMARY: Registry value set: | RuleName: - | EventType: SetValue\r\n\r\nEVENT_ID: evt-00060 | TS: 2026-05-06T00:00:15.098Z | CODE: 13 | CHAN: Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | IMG: C:\\windows\\Explorer.EXE | CMD: \r\n  MSG SUMMARY: Registry value set: | RuleName: - | EventType: SetValue\r\n\r\nEVENT_ID: evt-00061 | TS: 2026-05-06T00:00:15.098Z | CODE: 12 | CHAN: Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | IMG: C:\\windows\\Explorer.EXE | CMD: \r\n  MSG SUMMARY: Registry object added or deleted: | RuleName: - | EventType: CreateKey\r\n\r\nEVENT_ID: evt-00062 | TS: 2026-05-06T00:00:15.099Z | CODE: 12 | CHAN: Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | IMG: C:\\windows\\Explorer.EXE | CMD: \r\n  MSG SUMMARY: Registry object added or deleted: | RuleName: - | EventType: CreateKey\r\n\r\nEVENT_ID: evt-00063 | TS: 2026-05-06T00:00:15.099Z | CODE: 12 | CHAN: Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | IMG: C:\\windows\\Explorer.EXE | CMD: \r\n  MSG SUMMARY: Registry object added or deleted: | RuleName: - | EventType: CreateKey\r\n\r\nEVENT_ID: evt-00064 | TS: 2026-05-06T00:00:15.100Z | CODE: 12 | CHAN: Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | IMG: C:\\windows\\Explorer.EXE | CMD: \r\n  MSG SUMMARY: Registry object added or deleted: | RuleName: - | EventType: CreateKey\r\n\r\nEVENT_ID: evt-00065 | TS: 2026-05-06T00:00:15.100Z | CODE: 12 | CHAN: Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | IMG: C:\\windows\\Explorer.EXE | CMD: \r\n  MSG SUMMARY: Registry object added or deleted: | RuleName: - | EventType: CreateKey\r\n\r\n"]
