G: System ===\r\n  RawAccessRead detected:\r\n  RuleName: -\r\n  UtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:55.788\r\n  ProcessGuid: {860ba2e3-8b47-5f52-0100-000000000400}\r\n  ProcessId: 4\r\n--\r\n=== EVENT_ID: evt-00289 | CODE: 1 | IMG: C:\\Windows\\System32\\conhost.exe ===\r\n  Process Create:\r\n  RuleName: -\r\n  UtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:55.823\r\n  ProcessGuid: {860ba2e3-9f13-5f52-2803-000000000400}\r\n  ProcessId: 7700\r\n--\r\n=== EVENT_ID: evt-00293 | CODE: 9 | IMG: System ===\r\n  RawAccessRead detected:\r\n  RuleName: -\r\n  UtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:55.835\r\n  ProcessGuid: {860ba2e3-8b47-5f52-0100-000000000400}\r\n  ProcessId: 4\r\n--\r\n=== EVENT_ID: evt-00294 | CODE: 9 | IMG: System ===\r\n  RawAccessRead detected:\r\n  RuleName: -\r\n  UtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:55.835\r\n  ProcessGuid: {860ba2e3-8b47-5f52-0100-000000000400}\r\n  ProcessId: 4\r\n--\r\n=== EVENT_ID: evt-00297 | CODE: 9 | IMG: System ===\r\n  RawAccessRead detected:\r\n  RuleName: -\r\n  UtcTime: 2020-09-04 20:09:55.835\r\n  ProcessGuid: {860ba2e3-8b47-5f52-0100-000000000400}\r\n  ProcessId: 4\r\n--\r\n=== EVENT_ID: evt-00328 | CODE: 4688 | IMG:  ===\r\n  A new process has been created.\r\n  Creator Subject:\r\n  Security ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2079883792-3656946353-945924832-1104\r\n  Account Name:\t\tm.ward\r\n  Account Domain:\t\tCORP\r\n--\r\n=== EVENT_ID: evt-00340 | CODE: 4689 | IMG:  ===\r\n  A process has exited.\r\n  Subject:\r\n  Security ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2079883792-3656946353-945924832-1104\r\n  Account Name:\t\tm.ward\r\n  Account Domain:\t\tCORP\r\n--\r\n=== EVENT_ID: evt-00341 | CODE: 4673 | IMG:  ===\r\n  A privileged service was called.\r\n  Subject:\r\n  Security ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2079883792-3656946353-945924832-1104\r\n  Account Name:\t\tm.ward\r\n  Account Domain:\t\tCORP\r\n--\r\n=== EVENT_ID: evt-00343 | CODE: 4688 | IMG:  ===\r\n  A new process has been created.\r\n  Creator Subject:\r\n  Security ID:\t\tS-1-5-21-2079883792-3656946353-945924832-1104\r\n  Account Name:\t\tm.ward\r\n  Accou